// Generated by tools/ida_transcribe.py. Do not edit.
//
// Every type the decompiled signatures mention is forward-declared here
// so a class header never has to include another class header. The
// bodies only ever pass these around by pointer, which a forward
// declaration is enough for.
//
// Names the Runtime layer already defines, and names the C runtime owns,
// are deliberately absent: declaring those would be a redefinition.

